    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "La consulta SQL corregida y mejorada, que desagrega el recuento por formulación de rosuvastatina e incluye el nombre del fármaco, además de validar los `concept_id` con la tabla `concept`, es la siguiente:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    c.concept_name AS drug_formulation,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT de.person_id) AS number_of_people\nFROM\n    `drug_exposure` AS de\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS c\n    ON de.drug_concept_id = c.concept_id\nWHERE\n    de.drug_concept_id IN (40165254, 40165258)\n    AND c.domain_id = 'Drug'\n    AND c.vocabulary_id = 'RxNorm'\n    AND c.standard_concept = 'S'\nGROUP BY\n    c.concept_name, de.drug_concept_id\n```",
